ider the potential for multiple comparisons and adjust their significance levels accordingly.\n\n**Software Implementation:**\nMany statistical software packages, such as R, SAS, and SPSS, provide built-in functions for conducting contrast analyses within the framework of ANOVA. These tools often allow users to specify contrasts directly and provide output that includes significance tests and confidence intervals.\n\n**Common Applications or Examples:**\nContrasts are commonly used in agricultural experiments to compare the effects of different fertilizers on crop yield, in clinical trials to assess the efficacy of various treatments, and in psychological studies to evaluate the impact of different interventions on behavior. They are integral to any research design that involves multiple groups or treatments and where specific comparisons are of interest.", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": [], "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "protected_material_code": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "protected_material_text": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "sexual": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "violence": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}}}], "created": 1768462283, "model": "gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_f97eff32c5", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 845, "prompt_tokens": 304, "total_tokens": 1149, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}, "prompt_filter_results": [{"prompt_index": 0, "content_filter_results": {"hate": {"filtered": false, "severity": "safe"}, "jailbreak": {"filtered": false, "detected": false}, "self_harm": {"filtered": false, "